{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05495","headline":"阮公啸台 · 包融","name":"阮公啸台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒台森荆杞，蒙笼无上路。\n传是古人迹，阮公长啸处。\n至今清风来，时时动林树。\n逝者共已远，升攀想遗趣。\n静然荒榛门，久之若有悟。\n灵光未歇灭，千载知仰慕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}